2][S4T4].\n- Called opening the shop a \"labor of love\" — challenging, but \"so worth it\"; feeling the hard work pay off is \"like bringing something back to life\" (echoing his car-restoration sentiment), and he finds it incredible that his skills and hard work made it happen [S4T9][S4T11][S4T13].\n- Says the \"perfect blend of dedication and passion\" keeps him motivated and makes it all worthwhile; Calvin encouraged him to \"keep going for it!\" [S4T14][S4T15][S4T16].\n- Shared a second photo of the shop (a group of people standing in front of a car) and invited Calvin to come by sometime [S4T17].\n- Works on all kinds of cars at the shop — from regular maintenance to full restorations of classic cars — which \"keeps [him] busy and happy\" [S4T18][S4T19].\n- Working on cars is what he's passionate about: doing it every day is \"so rewarding\", \"seeing the transformation is awesome\", and he finds it satisfying to help people keep their cars in good condition [S4T21].\n- Appreciates Calvin's encouragement: \"It means a lot that my work is valued and that it brings joy to others\" [S4T23].","text_sha256":"9ffd3424715b8b1c60b896d1b0924f088e394d8d93564717bf7912442b9bf777","timestamp":"2023-05-01T18:24:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D13:17","D13:18","D13:19"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":201,"line_start":201,"source_locators":["[S13T17]","[S13T18]","[S13T19]"],"text_sha256":"27e0e65fbca71fe19fdf0be117a3abb98a6a4ce2b25949fc34e6db2933a8a966"},{"dia_ids":["D14:1","D14:2","D14:4","D14:5","D14:6","D14:7","D14:8","D14:9"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":202,"line_start":202,"source_locators":["[S14T1]","[S14T2]","[S14T4]","[S14T5]","[S14T6]","[S14T7]","[S14T8]","[S14T9]"],"text_sha256":"8fae6afe91a12bb8d0939d0bb7e1bece2d3a69fb700907548fbc109a93f2fa2c"},{"dia_ids":["D14:11","D14:12","D14:13","D14:15"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":203,"line_start":203,"source_loc