ndex":15,"source_sha256":"9cc26028aec1e448e0173052c2201be3ddc89704c60b6286beb383174aed8e55","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":5},{"dia_id":"D15:6","global_turn_index":262,"locator":"[S15T6]","raw_turn_sha256":"6914b795e6e84f5daec7734c53bf3187fac28137cfa6161a389a5e2f6e2c502f","rendered_turn_sha256":"3850ecc3a36c31d1b7b6cdc14dce65a03f143b767b883e402c63d616b1309ab3","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"b2b62bdbfef8f4b9b21972fe2e995adc309a4fb67786001a38e303584d84c26c","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":6},{"dia_id":"D15:7","global_turn_index":263,"locator":"[S15T7]","raw_turn_sha256":"4cb14f8bdb709e862411f50e816d12c6954080c9660927094e78026d158b24bb","rendered_turn_sha256":"6fdd00f6d22c42b30916db09b67f1b7b91602c88c418c7be550f3a045d4d4205","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"ef16a45ed1ec7cf23c71d8d41dd6c7c905bdaac5c833f9f80c1ffaca9d323175","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":7},{"dia_id":"D15:8","global_turn_index":264,"locator":"[S15T8]","raw_turn_sha256":"9af1ba689030eda71a7b77e81646c11c178028488b84bf8033f065df2fe09019","rendered_turn_sha256":"64e0eeace93b6a1c739d8bf14528b557eee23e4d90c888a3787a3d1d820486b8","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"967c01aaa2141158daa2dc3c85fc919a51ebce9643d8bb45820096ec28dbb7b0","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":8}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- The 2023-08-11 conversation ended with Dave telling Calvin \"No worries... Got it. Good luck with your music!\"; Calvin thanked him for the encouragement and said he'll keep working hard and making music, and Dave signed off \"See ya, Calvin! Stay awesome. Catch ya later.\" [S13T17][S13T18][S13T19].\n- On 2023-08-14, reconnected with Calvin (\"since last we talked\"): Dave told him he got to go to a car workshop in San Francisco (details in ## Car workshops in San Francisco); Calvin: \"That's awesome! Car workshops sound totally cool and inspiring. Glad you found something that really gets you going.\" [S14T1][S14T2]. Dave then asked what Calvin had been up to; Calvin told him the amazing experience of touring with the well-known artist — the tour ended with a show in Japan, and afterward he got to explore his new place (details in the Tokyo trip section of /memories/calvin.md). Dave bet playing for an eager audience was incredible and asked how Tokyo reacted to Calvin's music and about special moments; Calvin said the Tokyo show was \"awesome\" — the crowd sang along to one of his songs, \"a magical moment\" — and when Dave asked for pictures from the show, Calvin shared one (a crowd at the concert with their hands up), saying these moments are why he loves his job; Dave: \"The energy in that pic is awesome! Seeing everyone with their hands up must have been really cool. It's great when your passion brings joy to others!\" [S14T4][S14T5][S14T6][S14T7][S14T8][S14T9].\n- The 2023-08-14 conversation continued: Dave told Calvin the car restoration is \"going great\" and shared a photo of it (details in ## Car mod workshop (2023-08-11)); Calvin predicted it \"is going to look amazing when you're done\" and asked how long it would take. Dave said Calvin's support \"means a lot to [him]\" [S14T11][S14T12][S14T13][S14T15].\n- The 2023-08-14 conversation closed with Calvin cheering Dave on — \"You got this, Dave! I'm always here for you. Seeing your enthusiasm is amazing. Keep growing, buddy. It'll be worth it! Good luck with that. See ya!\" — after Calvin said Dave \"has some serious talent\" and he was \"really excited to see the end result of [Dave's] hard work\" [S14T14][S14T16].\n- On 2023-08-22, reconnected with Calvin (\"Haven't talked in a while!\"): Dave shared that he'd had a card night with friends on 2023-08-18 (details in ## Card night (2023-08-18)); Calvin told him he scored a deal to continue collaborating with Frank Ocean — \"a dream come true\" — and Dave: \"Wow Calvin, congrats! Super excited for you.\" and asked how the chance came up; Calvin explained that he met Frank at a music festival in Tokyo, they clicked, and they recorded a song in Calvin's mansion studio; Dave: \"Wow, Tokyo sounds like an incredible experience!\" and asked what it was like playing at the festival; Calvin described the buzzing energy, the lively crowd, and \"We all felt connected, it was amazing!\", sharing a photo of the crowd sitting on the grass at night (Calvin's side in the Frank Ocean collaboration section of /memories/calvin.md) [S15T1][S15T2][S15T3][S15T4][S15T5][S15T6][S15T7][S15T8].","text_sha256":"7a18035fbac7981e0984057b466e04bc9295c3b991db8990bcb3155ec769b57c","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D20:1"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":59,"line_start":59,"source_locators":["[S20T1]"],"text_sha256":"2141c6d9c79f7f729af57656c2152ba52be748391ec25305419f8fb704ff67c2"},{"dia_ids":["D21:4"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":60,"line_start":60,"source_locators":["[S21T4]"],"text_sha256":"362f20fe521c9f372fc2d105fbf0afb499bbd5626456527bf2b9a0935c231b21"},{"dia_ids":["D21:5","D21:6"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":61,"line_start":61,"source_locators":["[S21T5]","[S21T6]"],"text_sha256":"d9da18fec3d4f84f5a88701e0bdb90f5504475d3dd2fd2395007162e05697988"},{"dia_ids":["D21:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":62,"line_start":62,"source_locators":["[S21T8]"],"text_sha256":"2d72a4bda99fdfe51513115486a358508fb7d9d06919477e43daa607c6dbed45"},{"dia_ids":["D26:2","D26:3"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":63,"line_start":63,"source_locators":["[S26T2]","[S26T3]"],"text_sha256":"b694568197f9413eab5ebbdf0fecee8b7110ae96b79579b2d48f9243d09789ed"}],"dia_ids":["D20:1","D21